<title>USA: Hello Direct names Glover president.</title>
<headline>Hello Direct names Glover president.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hello Direct Inc said Monday its executive vice president, Alec Glover, was named president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Allen Batts, who resigned to pursue personal interests, but will remain a member of the board of directors. Glover was also named to the board of directors, expanding its size to six members.</p>
<p>Glover joined Hello Direct in 1995 as executive vice president. From 1983 to 1994 he was senior vice president of marketing and R&amp;D for Kransco Group Companies, a toy and sporting goods company.</p>
